Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 19:27:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: simplify app list layout and remove title bar

    Drop the LinearLayout wrapper and embedded title bar from the app
    drawer layout. The GridView is now the root element, and the
    activity requests FEATURE_NO_TITLE to suppress the system
    ActionBar.

Change-Id: Ieb491894f817ad80e1553e719b3396f2df7b57a5
---
 .../SystemUI/res/layout/activity_app_list.xml | 56 ++++---------------
 .../systemui/applist/AppListActivity.java     |  4 +-
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)

